                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Snake Blocks is a unique puzzle game where you need to drag your snake from point A to B within a specific amount of moves. \n\nThe levels are well designed, get harder as you progress, take only a few minutes each to clear, and can be challenging.\nWith 50 levels and a level editor to create your own levels, the game offers a good amount of content to keep you busy for a while.\n\nSadly enough, the controls and camera angles are so frustrating, it makes the game unplayable. \nMy snake keeps going in directions where I don't want him to go, it's so annoying! \nThis puzzle game had potential and the problems could have been fixed easily...",
